s, and anyone who loves world-class Jiu-Jitsu.\n\nWatch exciting matches, explore the venue, and experience the action from angles you could never see in real life. From highlight shows to live-style events, you\u2019ll feel like you\u2019re sitting mat-side as top competitors showcase skill, strategy, and heart.\n\nBetween matches, walk through interactive spaces designed to celebrate the culture of Jiu-Jitsu. Visit virtual shops, discover exclusive products, and unlock in-game items \u2014 or purchase real Place of Peace gear you can wear in the real world.\n\nMore than a competition, Place of Peace VR is a community hub. Hang out with friends, meet other fans, and follow your favorite grapplers as they chase greatness on the world stage.\n\n\n\nFeatures include:\n\nWatch Place of Peace BJJ Invitational events and shows\n\nGet immersive, up-close views of championship-level grappling\n\nBuy in-game items and unlock special content\n\nShop real merchandise and official Place of Peace gear\n\nConnect with athletes and fans inside a positive, inspiring environment\n\n\nThe future of Jiu-Jitsu is interactive.\n\nStep into the arena and experience peace, power, and competition in VR.\n\n", "short_description": "Enter the Place of Peace BJJ Invitational:\n\nWatch elite grapplers, shop exclusive gear, and experience Jiu-Jitsu like never before.\n\nTrain, watch, and shop inside the official Place of Peace BJJ Invitational VR arena:\n\nWhere champions compete and fans connect.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.placeofpeacebjj.com/blank-2", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Place of Peace Brazilian Jiu Jitsu LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://placeofpeacebjj.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1228796255027646"}, {"id": "26876553382